    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">The Mali Elephants Project, Phase VI: developing long-term stakeholder capacity for elephant conservation in Mali</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This project works to secure Gourmas desert-adapted elephants by supporting anti-poaching patrols and promoting protection by local residents through the community-based eco-guardian program. Specific activities will include recruitment of two additional anti-poaching teams, provide ongoing support to local residents participating in the eco-guardian program, and convening workshops to improve integration between local, regional and national government entities to improve security for wildlife and people.</narrative>
